@freeIpApiUrl = https://free.freeipapi.com/api/v1/json

### Identify country for IPv4 address (PL)
GET {{freeIpApiUrl}}/83.0.0.1
Accept: application/json

### Identify country for IPv6 address (DE)
GET {{freeIpApiUrl}}/2a02:8108::1
Accept: application/json

### Identify country for not supported country (US)
GET {{freeIpApiUrl}}/8.8.8.8
Accept: application/json

### Private IP address - HTTP 200 with countryCode null
GET {{freeIpApiUrl}}/10.0.0.1
Accept: application/json
